<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 111,999.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 111,999.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Feb 4 totaled 111,999 bales, up from 108,180 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 3,819 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 13,633 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212 859 1640</p>
